      },
      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### AI Service Health Monitoring\n\nThis dashboard provides a unified view of GPU health and AI service performance across all inference services.\n\n**Models Served:** Triton via ai-gateway (yolo26, florence2, clip, enrichment models) + Nemotron (llama.cpp sidecar)\n\n**Key Indicators:**\n- **GPU Inference Failures**: nv_inference_request_failure per Triton model — VRAM exhaustion (OOM) surfaces here. Any sustained failure is a critical signal.\n- **GPU Memory Utilization**: Per-service VRAM usage as a percentage of available memory.\n- **Service Error Rate**: Rate of failed inference requests per service.\n- **Latency Percentiles**: P50/P95/P99 inference latency to detect degradation.\n\n**Alert Thresholds:** OOM > 0 = Critical | Error rate > 1% = Warning | P95 latency > 2x baseline = Warning"
      },
      "title": "Documentation",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 10,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "GPU Inference Failures (OOM Signal)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Failed Triton inferences per model (5m increase). VRAM exhaustion surfaces as failed inferences; any sustained failure indicates a model hit GPU memory limits.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "Failed Inferences",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#F2495C",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["sum", "lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.2.3",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "increase(nv_inference_request_failure[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Failed Inferences per Model (5m windows)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
